5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I wonder if we might look into the winter road closures and the county grant terms to ensure our plans are sustainable.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree we should be cautious. I would like to see the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what happened before! I'll check the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A very prudent start. I shall examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I will focus on the human element. I'll look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
